{"path":"chemistry/organic/inference/toluene-chlorination","title":"等效氢变式·甲苯苯环上的一氯代物","type":"example","html":"<p>甲苯（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{C_6H_5CH_3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）苯环上的一氯代物有（ ）（只取代苯环上的氢）</p>\n<p>A. <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span> 种</p>\n<p>B. <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span> 种</p>\n<p>C. <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span> 种</p>\n<p>D. <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span> 种</p>\n<p><img src=\"img/chemistry/toluene-chlorination.svg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>注意题眼：<strong>&quot;苯环上&quot;</strong>——若说&quot;一氯代物（光照）&quot;则是甲基上取代（苄基氯，1 种）；&quot;FeCl₃ 催化/苯环上&quot;= 邻间对 3 种（卤代苯环）；</li>\n<li>对二取代产物：邻、间、对 3 种；苯环上<strong>两个不同基</strong>的第二取代数法（分别把两个基定在邻/间/对再数第三位置）——考到先分&quot;两基相对位&quot;三类再数；</li>\n<li>变式：硝基苯（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{C_6H_5NO_2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）苯环上一硝化产物也是 3 种（邻/间/对）——取代基不同结论相同；</li>\n<li>真题关联：芳香烃同分异构与取代计数为新高考化学选填必考。🔗 真题公开资料：<a href=\"https://gaokao.neea.edu.cn/\">中国教育考试网·普通高考</a>（官方试题评析）。</li>\n</ul>\n","standardHtml":"<p>甲苯苯环上有 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span> 个氢，但对称位置等效。以 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{-CH_3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为&quot;1 位&quot;，苯环其余位置相对甲基有两类对称：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>2 位与 6 位等效</strong>（关于过 1-4 的轴左右对称）；</li>\n<li><strong>3 位与 5 位等效</strong>；</li>\n<li><strong>4 位</strong>（对位）单独。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>⇒ 等效氢 3 种：邻（2 位）、间（3 位）、对（4 位）⇒ 一氯代物 3 种。</p>\n<p>选 <strong>A</strong>。</p>\n","evilHtml":"<p><strong>口诀</strong>：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>&quot;邻间对，三兄弟&quot;</strong>——固定第一个取代基后，苯环上其余位置按对称性只分&quot;邻、间、对&quot;三类；任何单取代苯在苯环上引入第二个取代基，产物都是 3 种（除非取代基本身引入新的不对称）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><strong>为什么</strong>：苯环正六边形旋转对称，固定第一个取代基在&quot;1 位&quot;后，剩余 5 个位置被&quot;上下对称&quot;折叠成 3 类：2'6'（邻）、3'5'（间）、4（对）——对称性是数法不重不漏的唯一依据。</p>\n<p>30 秒出 A。</p>\n","meta":{"status":"draft","keywords":[],"summary":"甲苯（ C 6 H 5 C H 3 \\mathrm{C_6H_5CH_3} C 6 ​ H 5 ​ C H 3 ​ ）苯环上的一氯代物有（ ）（只取代苯环上的氢） A. 3 3 3 种 B. 2 2 2 种 C. 4 4 4 种 D. 5 ","source":"自编（经典考法：芳香烃取代物计数）","difficulty":"中等","applicability":"选填通用","risk":"苯环上的取代（卤代/硝化）只发生在苯环上，甲基上的氢（苄位）若也算则数量不同——题目问\"苯环上\"时只数环上碳所连氢；对称轴：= 甲基对位轴与过甲基的垂直轴，三种位置（邻、间、对）。","fit":["甲苯苯环上的一氯代物","对称性数位置","选填题"],"updated":"Fri Mar 07 2025 08:00:00 GMT+0800 (中国标准时间)"},"breadcrumbs":[{"slug":"chemistry","title":"化学"},{"slug":"organic","title":"有机化学基础"},{"slug":"inference","title":"有机推断与合成"},{"slug":"toluene-chlorination","title":"等效氢变式·甲苯苯环上的一氯代物"}],"children":[],"siblings":[{"slug":"aromatic-isomer-inference","title":"芳香族同分异构（银镜+水解=甲酸酯）","type":"example"},{"slug":"equivalent-h","title":"等效氢法·一氯代物数目比较","type":"example"},{"slug":"flow-template","title":"有机推断大题·醇醛酸酯链（模板）","type":"example"},{"slug":"isomer-count","title":"同分异构体数（基元法）","type":"example"},{"slug":"organic-flow-inference","title":"有机流程推断（连续氧化链定位）","type":"example"},{"slug":"organic-inference-demo","title":"有机推断（特征反应定位）","type":"example"},{"slug":"organic-inference","title":"有机推断与合成","type":"knowledge"},{"slug":"synthesis-route","title":"乙烯合成乙酸乙酯（连续氧化链）","type":"example"}]}